 "kind": "component",
 "name": "Button Linkstyle",
 "slug": "button-linkstyle",
 "order": 5,
 "figmaSetName": "Button Linkstyle",
 "description": "Text-link styled button (used for disclosures and inline CTAs such as \"Forgot password?\"). Underlined brand-primary text at rest; a 1px brand-primary box appears on Hover/Pressed.",
 "componentDescription": null,
 "specText": "Button Linkstyle | Last Updated: 2026.10.02 | Components | UPDATED: 2026.09.30 | Button Linkstyle | Updated: 2026.09.30 | 1 Row | Stacked | Default | Hover | Pressed | InFocus | Button Linkstyle | Updated: 2026.09.30 | Button Linkstyle\nSize: 157×38px (1row) / 91×60px (stacked)\nCorner Radius: 4px (Hover, Pressed, and InFocus box states only; Default has no box)\nPadding: 8px all sides\nText: Noto Sans Regular 16px\nText Color: color/theme/primary / #007580\nBorder: none by default (underlined text instead); 1px color/theme/primary border appears on Hover/Pressed (underline removed); InFocus adds a 2px black focus ring, offset 1px outside, plus the 1px Hover-style border\n\nMargin: not yet established for this component (unlike the CTA buttons' 8px min left/right margin) — flagging as an open spec gap. | States | Updated: 2026.09.30 | Default — resting appearance. Underlined text, no box border. | Hover — underline is removed; a 1px color/theme/primary border appears around the content area, corner radius 4px. | Pressed — same styling as Hover (1px color/theme/primary border, corner radius 4px). Now its own separate variant rather than combined with Hover. | InFocus — adds a 2px black focus ring, offset 1px outside, in addition to the 1px Hover-style border. Appears on keyboard (Tab) focus for accessibility.",
