 "knownIssues": [
  "**Margin not specified** (open spec gap, per the Figma Specifications column).",
  "**4 of 8 variants have 0 instances** anywhere in the file: `Stacked / Default`, `Stacked / Hover`, `Stacked / Pressed`, `Stacked / InFocus`.",
  "**3 variants are placed only in their own documentation frame** (not yet used in any real layout): `1 Row / Hover`, `1 Row / Pressed`, `1 Row / InFocus`."
 ],
